The two streams carry different things: stdout is the diff alone, so it can be piped, and
the `updated …` summary is stderr's only line.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: backlog
---
# Body
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md status=done owner=ann
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
 ---
 title: Foo
-status: backlog
+status: done
+owner: ann
 ---
 # Body
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: status=done, owner=ann
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: done
owner: ann
---
# Body
